Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:05.81,op zh-1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3}竟是这般{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}绚{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}烂瑰丽{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}色{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}彩缤纷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:07.53,op zh-1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3\pos(320,333)}有什么东西在我心中悄然{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:10.44,op zh-1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3}{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}棱{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}镜会将{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}相{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:16.95,op zh-1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3}{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}折{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}射成七彩光芒 一切都闪闪发{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:25.08,op zh-1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3}{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}因{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}为有些事物 独自一人是无法{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}看{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}见的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:10.87,ed jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}晴れ切った空の下 困り笑い
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:17.21,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}捕まえては逃げる僕をあなたは追いかけていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:20.71,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}伸びた影の繋いだ手に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:22.54,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}握ってたもの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:25.13,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}気付かないまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:28.38,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}少し大人になってしまってた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:34.39,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}振り払ってた優しい手のひら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:40.44,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}幾つになれば素直になれるのか？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:49.53,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}あの日の忘れたい夢の続きはもう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:53.15,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}いつの間にか消えてしまったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.12,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}願ったはずでも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.45,0:22:56.62,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}なぜだろう？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:23:01.42,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}埋められないほかの誰でも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.17,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}いつの間にか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:07.01,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}また必要になってしまっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.01,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}あなたのこと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:13.35,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}いつの日にか伝わるかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:15.89,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}僕の心のまま
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:18.97,ed jp,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}ありがとうと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:10.87,ed zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}响晴的天空下 无奈苦笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:17.21,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}你追逐着一度被抓住 却又逃掉的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:20.71,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}拉长的身影相牵的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:22.54,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}紧握的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:25.13,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}我们还没有察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:28.38,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}便已经渐渐长大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:34.39,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}曾经挥开了那只温柔的手掌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:40.44,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}我们要长到几岁才能真正变得坦率呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:49.53,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}那一天想要忘记的梦的后续
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:53.15,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}已在不知不觉间消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.12,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}本该是求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.45,0:22:56.62,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}可不知为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:23:01.42,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}其他任何人都无法填补我的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.17,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}于是不知何时起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:07.01,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}你的存在于我而言又变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.01,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}不可或缺
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:13.35,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}将来我是否能够告诉你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:15.89,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}由衷地说出
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:18.97,ed zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}谢谢你
